    "detailed_description": "<strong><u>Magic and Technology Alliance</u></strong><br>Two worlds, two powers! <strong>Magic Versus Mind</strong> combines strategy and action, inviting you to a thrilling adventure. Choose your side, develop your skills, and defeat your opponents in a world where magic and technology reign. Get ready for a gaming experience full of new levels, unique mechanics, and an engaging story!<br><br><strong><u>NEW LEVELS AND STORY</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Test your skills on challenging and immersive levels with various themes. Find ways to survive in a world filled with wizards and technology masters!<br></li><li>Choose your side in the epic battle between magic and technology and determine the course of the story!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289320/extras/mvsm1.gif?t=1751127291\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>ADVANCED MECHANICS AND STRATEGY</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Utilize the unique abilities and tools of both sides to gain strategic advantages. Overcome your enemies with technology or trap them with magic!<br></li><li>Each gaming experience will be unique with dynamic combat systems and diverse character classes.</li></ul><br><strong><u>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Costumes: Customize your character\u2019s appearance with a variety of costumes.<br></li><li>Skill Sets: Customize your character\u2019s skills and abilities to gain strategic advantages.<br></li><li>Pet Customization: Choose different appearances and abilities for your pets to make them more effective in battle.<br></li><li>Colors and Patterns: Change the colors and patterns of your character and pets to reflect your personal style.<br></li><li>Accessories: Add various accessories to your character to complete their look and create a unique style.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289320/extras/413e027bab22ebc95069cd4538932939.poster.avif?t=1751127291\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289320/extras/413e027bab22ebc95069cd4538932939.webm?t=1751127291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289320/extras/413e027bab22ebc95069cd4538932939.mp4?t=1751127291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><u>SKILL SYSTEM</u></strong><br><br>Players earn permanent rank levels while playing. As the rank increases, random active skills are added to the inventory. These active skills can be customized from the inventory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289320/extras/keer.jpg?t=1751127291\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>WAVE MODULE</u></strong><br><br>In this module, players clear waves of enemies sequentially. Each wave contains increasingly difficult enemies, and each section ends with clearing a specific number of waves. Once all waves are completed, players advance to the next level. At the end of each section, players face a special boss fight, and defeating the boss grants access to higher levels and rewards.<br><br><strong><u>OBJECTIVE MODULE</u></strong><br><br>In this game mode, we encounter continuously arriving creatures while trying to complete tasks. Completing tasks allows you to move to the next level.<br><br><strong><u>BOOSTER SYSTEM</u></strong><br><br>As you level up during gameplay, three random passive skills will appear on the main screen for you to choose from. These skills are passive.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><u>Magic and Technology Alliance</u></strong><br>Two worlds, two powers! <strong>Magic Versus Mind</strong> combines strategy and action, inviting you to a thrilling adventure. Choose your side, develop your skills, and defeat your opponents in a world where magic and technology reign. Get ready for a gaming experience full of new levels, unique mechanics, and an engaging story!<br><br><strong><u>NEW LEVELS AND STORY</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Test your skills on challenging and immersive levels with various themes. Find ways to survive in a world filled with wizards and technology masters!<br></li><li>Choose your side in the epic battle between magic and technology and determine the course of the story!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289320/extras/mvsm1.gif?t=1751127291\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>ADVANCED MECHANICS AND STRATEGY</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Utilize the unique abilities and tools of both sides to gain strategic advantages. Overcome your enemies with technology or trap them with magic!<br></li><li>Each gaming experience will be unique with dynamic combat systems and diverse character classes.</li></ul><br><strong><u>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Costumes: Customize your character\u2019s appearance with a variety of costumes.<br></li><li>Skill Sets: Customize your character\u2019s skills and abilities to gain strategic advantages.<br></li><li>Pet Customization: Choose different appearances and abilities for your pets to make them more effective in battle.<br></li><li>Colors and Patterns: Change the colors and patterns of your character and pets to reflect your personal style.<br></li><li>Accessories: Add various accessories to your character to complete their look and create a unique style.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289320/extras/413e027bab22ebc95069cd4538932939.poster.avif?t=1751127291\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289320/extras/413e027bab22ebc95069cd4538932939.webm?t=1751127291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289320/extras/413e027bab22ebc95069cd4538932939.mp4?t=1751127291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><u>SKILL SYSTEM</u></strong><br><br>Players earn permanent rank levels while playing. As the rank increases, random active skills are added to the inventory. These active skills can be customized from the inventory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1289320/extras/keer.jpg?t=1751127291\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>WAVE MODULE</u></strong><br><br>In this module, players clear waves of enemies sequentially. Each wave contains increasingly difficult enemies, and each section ends with clearing a specific number of waves. Once all waves are completed, players advance to the next level. At the end of each section, players face a special boss fight, and defeating the boss grants access to higher levels and rewards.<br><br><strong><u>OBJECTIVE MODULE</u></strong><br><br>In this game mode, we encounter continuously arriving creatures while trying to complete tasks. Completing tasks allows you to move to the next level.<br><br><strong><u>BOOSTER SYSTEM</u></strong><br><br>As you level up during gameplay, three random passive skills will appear on the main screen for you to choose from. These skills are passive.",
